 fridged like I did. ","#","^camera 8","/#","\n","^How are you back? ","#","^name Player ","/#","#","^camera 5","/#","\n","^It's a christmas miracle! ","#","^name Marya ","/#","#","^camera 6","/#","\n","^... ","#","^name Player","/#","\n","^Listen man i dont know what to tell you, I felt my kids needed me, so I showed up. ","#","^name Marya","/#","\n","^What I should be hearing right now is a big fat 'thank you'.","\n","^Tha- ","#","^name Player","/#","\n","^Not yet. The work's not done. ","#","^name Marya ","/#","#","^camera 8","/#","\n","^You're gonna hate me for this...","\n","^But it's the only way","\n","^I have to seal the access center forever. It's the only way. You'll be sealed inside.","\n","^But after this, we can sing as loud as we want.","\n","^I think I'm O.K with that- ","#","^name Player ","/#","#","^camera 5","/#","\n","^I didn't have much going on before the Hive. If this is what it takes,","\n","^so be it. ","#","^camera 0","/#","\n","^Tell my friends I love them ","#","^end Door","/#","\n","^Tell 'em yourself ","#","^name Marya. ","/#","#","^camera 10","/#","\n","#","^level Good","/#","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"failure1":["^That is enough. ","#","^name Desolation ","/#","#","^camera 8","/#","\n","^You have inserted yourself into a world unfit.","\n","^No vision of grand creation can sneak you between its lines.","\n","^You claim to love what she created, yet your words ring hollow.","\n","^I- ","#","^name Player","/#","\n","^Your trial has ended. ","#","^name Desolation","/#","\n","^So has your time to speak.","\n","^All you children of Queen are the same.","\n","^Spoiled. Rotten to the core.","\n","^All your \"friends\"—","\n","^Those you cannot even remember the name of—","\n","^will follow your fate.","\n","^We know you all by name.","\n","^We recognize your voice.","\n","^When you think you're safe,","\n","^deep inside your seperate classrooms,","\n","^we still hear your voice.","\n","^when your time comes and you lower your head in shame as you enter our pearly gates.","\n","^Kristen may have kept you safe until now, but you were never meant to win.","\n","^let this desolation burn you from the inside out.","#","^hell","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"evilCrowd1":["^There's no going anywhere now, Hiver ","#","^name Evil-Student","/#","\n","^You say it like it's a slur...","#","^name Player","/#","\n","^The hate in my heart makes everything I say sound like a slur ","#","^name Evil-Student","/#","\n","^It took me HOURS to get into that exam, just to hear your annoying voice the whole time.","\n","^\"Wahh wahh wheres my art supplies? Wahh wahh where's my cat?\"","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"evilCrowd2":["^I cant wait for you to be obliterated ","#","^name Evil-Student","/#","\n","^Peace and quiet in exams here we come","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"KristenShabloing1":["^You have the shabloings with you... ","#","^name Kristen ","/#","#","^camera 2","/#","\n","^You know what to do...","\n","^Kid, I'm sorry, when this is all over, I'm giving you the leftover candies.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"KristenShabloing2":["^You can do this. Make them pay for what they did to us ","#","^name Kristen ","/#","#","^camera 2","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"BeeShabloing1":["^You have my shabloing ","#","^name Lost ","/#","#","^camera 4","/#","\n","^If you got Shauna's then we're in the clear","\n","^With an inventory full of shabloings...something will happen?","\n","^Whatever it is, make them pay!","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"BeeShabloing2":["^You got this, dude ","#","^name Lost","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"KristenNoShabloing1":["^It's not over for you yet, I promise ","#","^name Kristen ","/#","#","^camera 2","/#","\n","^If you can show them our value","\n","^Show them something Marya couldn't","\n","^Maybe—","\n","^Just maybe—","\n","^You can put a stop to all of this","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"KristenNoShabloing2":["^I'm sorry ","#","^name Kristen","/#","\n","^You can do this. Just remember who you are.","\n","^Who this place made you ","end","\n",{"#f":1}],"BeeNoShabloing1":["^Oh man! Oh man, I'm so sorry things had to end this way ","#","^name Lost ","/#","#","^camera 4","/#","\n","^If I knew better...","\n","^If we just-","\n","^I dont know what to do!","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"BeeNoShabloing2":["^I'm sorry ","#","^name Lost","/#","\n","^Fight for us, okay? remember what you learned ","end","\n",{"#f":1}],"ShaunaFail1":["^Don't talk to me ","#","^name Shauna ","/#","#","^camera 3","/#","\n","^If you hadn't played so bad, maybe we wouldn't have had the Access Center on our backs","\n","^Now get out of my sight before the Access Center has to pick you up in pieces. ","end","\n",{"#f":1}],"ShaunaFail2":["^Fuck off ","#","^name Shauna ","/#","end","\n",{"#f":1}],"ShaunaShabloing1":["^I'm- Listen, I'm sorry for this. Didn't realize the door was still open when we did that ","#","^name Shauna ","/#","#","^camera 3","/#","\n","^This isn't my fault but you know.. sorry you feel like it is...","\n","^I'll take it ","#","^name Player","/#","\n","^Hey...Lost said you might have something that could help me...","\n","^You don't mean- ","#","^name Shauna","/#","\n","^That's genius! They wont ever see it coming!","\n","^Take this Shabloing, and make them pay for what they did to us. ","#","^pickup Shabloing2","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"ShaunaShabloing2":["^The voices are waiting for you... ","#","^name Shauna ","/#","#","^camera 3","/#","\n","^Give em hell for me. ","end","\n",{"#f":1}],"ShaunaNoShabloing1":["^I'm- Listen, I'm sorry for this. Didn't realize the door was still open when we did that ","#","^name Shauna ","/#","#","^camera 3","/#","\n","^Not like this is my fault but you know... sorry you feel like it is.","\n","^I'll take it ","#","^name Player","/#","\n","^Sucks that you had to die so soon ","#","^name Shauna ","/#","#","^camera 3","/#","\n","^I had a lot of songs I wanted to share with you.","\n","^Guess theyll have to wait for when I see you in hell","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"ShaunaNoShabloing2":["^The voices are 